    "scripts/agent-test.sh ABORTS EARLY on a known-red fixture, so its aggregate exit is vacuous and the new `test-seat-path-guard` arm may never be reached in an aggregate run. Per the brief I did NOT run agent-test.sh in aggregate. The suite is fully runnable standalone (`bash scripts/tests/test_seat_path_guard.sh`) and that is how it was verified, including from an unrelated cwd to prove SCRIPT_DIR/REPO_ROOT resolution.",
