    "The suite grew from the brief's 16 required arms to 55 assertions across 43 numbered arms. All 16 required arms are present with their required verdicts. The additions are: the four hook-shape assertions (exists / executable / bash shebang / fail-open EXIT trap present); one Bash write-verb arm each for tee, cp, mv, rm, dd of=, git checkout --, git restore, inline python3 -c, inline node -e, truncate; absolute-path-in-another-worktree; `..` traversal laundering; four extra false-positive guards; unhandled-tool; non-guarded agent_type; both directions of env-vs-payload precedence; the spawned-subagent shape (agent_id + agent_type together); case/whitespace tolerance; and two stderr-silence arms. Three malformed-input sub-arms were added to arm 12 (JSON with no tool_input, valid JSON of the wrong shape, empty stdin).",
