    "FIX-1 SCOPE DISCIPLINE. Exactly the three permitted files were touched across the two fix-1 commits: .claude/hooks/seat-path-guard.sh, scripts/tests/test_seat_path_guard.sh, and this output.json. `git status --porcelain` before the GREEN commit listed those two code files and nothing else. The DO-NOT-TOUCH list holds: .claude/settings.json is still UNTOUCHED and still UNTRACKED (`git ls-files | grep -c 'claude/settings'` = 0), so THE HOOK REMAINS UNWIRED and suite arm 16 still passes against the primary checkout's real settings.json and settings.local.json; .claude/agents/*.md and every `tools:` frontmatter line, both ledgers and the .seq, the 0.8.20 plan/board/release-state, src/conformance/governed-surface-allowlist.json, dev/design/orchestration.md, AGENTS.md, and ASH-A's already-reviewed .gitignore and scripts/agent-test.sh hunks were all left alone. No worktree was created, moved or removed; no landed commit was rewritten; nothing was pushed.",
