    "FIX-1 RED-FIRST EVIDENCE, recorded because an arm that has never been red proves nothing (TC-37). The 13 new arm groups were written and committed FIRST (a3fb137b) and run against the unfixed hook at d31430ce: rc=1, 72 PASS / 7 FAIL, and the 7 failures were exactly the two findings and nothing else. Verbatim shape of each: arm 47 expected NO decision, got `permissionDecision=deny` with reason \"may not write 's/src/lib/' — it is under a 'src/' path segment\"; arm 48 likewise on \"'s/tests/checks/' ... 'tests/' path segment\"; arm 49 likewise on \"'s/engine/motor/' ... 'engine/' path segment\"; arm 50 likewise on \"src/rust/lib.rs,' ... 'src/' path segment\" (the shredded shard); arms 53, 54 and 54b each expected `permissionDecision=deny` and got '<silent>' with empty stdout. After the fix: 81 PASS / 0 FAIL, rc=0, with every one of the pre-existing 42 arms still green.",
